      "before": "kpk1-l18-a2-e01",
      "title": {
        "en": "Na ścianie, na podłodze"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "A room has *ściana* (a wall), *podłoga* (a floor), *sufit* (a ceiling), *okno* and *drzwi* (a door: *drzwi* is always plural). On a wall or a floor is *na*: *na ścianie*, *na podłodze*, *na suficie*. *Przy* is by: *przy oknie*, *przy drzwiach*. A flat in *blok* (a block of flats) is *na parterze* (on the ground floor) or *na piętrze* (upstairs, on a floor)."
      }
    }
  ],
